      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-24T02:28:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think what you guys have said is the intended interaction between HtR and Fowls.</p>\n<p>However, for me, the strange wording is making me confused. Essentially, the question is, how do I interpret the trigger conditions? Between the phrases “Whenever a non-hero target enters play” and “When this card is played from the villain deck”, which triggers earlier with respect to the other? Or do both trigger at the same instant?</p>",
